# The image ships what package.json's `files` list ships, and this is the other half of
# saying so. Two things in particular must never end up in a published image:
#   games/          the DOS Diversions -- shareware, not ours to redistribute
#   config/local.json  a deployment's RPC password
.git
.github
node_modules
data
worklog
games
test
umbrel/blockyard
config/local.json
config/local.json.bak-*
config/blockyard.json
docs/STATE-*.md
docs/PRIVATE-*.md
docs/images
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
.claude
